### Support Ticket API — colección de ejemplo
### Pensada para la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code (o el HTTP Client de
### JetBrains, compatible con esta sintaxis). Requiere haber corrido antes:
###   python manage.py seed_demo
### que crea agent_1, agent_2, customer_1, customer_2, customer_3, todos con
### contraseña "demo12345" (ver README.md → Credenciales de prueba).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### Token — agente
# @name loginAgent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "agent_1",
  "password": "demo12345"
}

### Token — cliente
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "customer_1",
  "password": "demo12345"
}

### Refrescar el access token del agente
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{loginAgent.response.body.$.refresh}}"
}

### Quién soy
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}

### Agentes disponibles (para elegir a quién asignar)
# @name listAgents
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}

### Crear una solicitud (como cliente) — CA-01
# @name createTicket
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "No enciende",
  "description": "El equipo no enciende desde ayer.",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Crear sin asunto — CA-02, debe dar 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Sin asunto",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Listar mis solicitudes (cliente ve solo las propias) — CA-03
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.access}}

### Listar todas, filtradas por estado (agente ve todo) — CA-04
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/?status=NEW&ordering=-created_at
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}

### Detalle de la solicitud creada
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}

### Asignarla a un agente — CA-05
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/assign/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigned_to": {{listAgents.response.body.$.results[0].id}}
}

### Pasar a IN_PROGRESS — CA-07
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/status/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Transición inválida directa a algo no permitido — CA-08, debe dar 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/status/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "NEW"
}

### Comentario interno (agente) — CA-10
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/comments/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Diagnóstico en curso, se reemplaza la fuente de poder.",
  "is_internal": true
}

### El cliente lista comentarios y NO ve el interno — CA-10
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/comments/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.access}}

### El cliente no puede cambiar el estado — CA-11, debe dar 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/status/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED"
}

### Resolver (agente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/status/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED",
  "note": "Se reemplazó la fuente de poder."
}

### Cerrar (cliente autor, desde RESOLVED) — CA-14
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/status/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CLOSED"
}

### Historial completo, orden cronológico descendente — CA-12
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/history/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}

### Escribir sobre el historial da 405 — CA-12
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/history/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}

### Ya cerrada: cualquier cambio da 409 — CA-09
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}/status/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.$.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}
